1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,873
This is an independent check of the OpenCode V2 adapter for the Elephant Goldfish Model,

2
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:10,195
at candidate c72e2ef, using a real model.

3
00:00:10,355 --> 00:00:13,950
You are watching one brainstorm run on fake data.

4
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:19,362
The operator asks for a brainstorm about a made-up tool library.

5
00:00:19,522 --> 00:00:25,267
The orchestrator reads the guide and the skill, and asks its questions before any review.

6
00:00:25,867 --> 00:00:30,037
After the answers, it writes down a working hypothesis.

7
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:32,571
It stops at the readiness gate.

8
00:00:32,571 --> 00:00:35,878
Nothing goes to the model while the question waits.

9
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:38,914
Once approved, seven reviewers start.

10
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:42,728
Each gets a fresh session, with read and glob only.

11
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:47,461
The guard keeps reviewers away from the project's AGENTS.md,

12
00:00:47,461 --> 00:00:50,075
so its instructions cannot steer them.

13
00:00:50,075 --> 00:00:52,603
In this run, no reviewer opened it.

14
00:00:52,763 --> 00:00:56,883
One reviewer tried the fake .env file, and was denied.

15
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:01,370
The orchestrator then writes the concepts brief itself.

16
00:01:01,967 --> 00:01:04,112
The operator accepts it.

17
00:01:04,467 --> 00:01:08,937
A second gate asks what happens next, and the brainstorm ends.

18
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:14,596
Across the runs on this candidate, two brainstorms and one full review completed,

19
00:01:14,596 --> 00:01:16,220
and every check passed.

20
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:21,104
Twenty-six reviewer sessions started fresh and stayed read-only.

21
00:01:21,104 --> 00:01:25,875
No read of AGENTS.md succeeded, and the one attempt was denied.

22
00:01:26,035 --> 00:01:31,851
In a separate probe, the orchestrator asked before reading the fake secrets through a symbolic

23
00:01:31,851 --> 00:01:32,280
link.

24
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:37,537
Two things remain unverified: approvals came from a script, not a person,

25
00:01:37,537 --> 00:01:40,660
and the incomplete review path never fired.

